'''Secondary Encumber''' is a [[Arcane Enhancement#Secondary Weapon Arcanes|Secondary Arcane]] that, on a [[Status Effect|status effect]] from a secondary weapon, has a chance to apply an additional random status effect.

Can be sold for {{cc|1,000}}.

==Effect==
{| class="emodtable"
